    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Vector of <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_inter_face" kindref="compound">InterFace</ref> (higher-dim) <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> - face idx pairs and <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> co-located with <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_inter_face" kindref="compound">InterFace</ref> (if present). For each <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_inter_face" kindref="compound">InterFace</ref> we have a pair or <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> pointer - face ID pairs 1) inner higher-dim element pointer 2) local face number of element face that is located at interface to outer element 3) outer higher-dim element pointer 4) local face number of element face that is located at interface to innner element 5) pointer to potential lower-dimensional intervening <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
